{"t": 1795075580.4702635, "tool": "analyze", "code": "from scipy.optimize import least_squares\nforms={\n'log1p+lin':lambda p:p[0]*np.log(1+p[1]*t)+p[2]*t+p[3],\n'pow shift':lambda p:p[0]*(t+p[1])**p[2]+p[3],\n'log+pow':lambda p:p[0]*np.log(t)+p[1]*t**p[2]+p[3],\n'exp+lin':lambda p:p[0]*np.exp(-p[1]*t)+p[2]*t+p[3],\n'rat':lambda p:p[0]*t/(1+p[1]*t)+p[2]*t+p[3],\n'tanh':lambda p:p[0]*np.tanh(p[1]*t)+p[2]*t+p[3],\n'atan':lambda p:p[0]*np.arctan(p[1]*t)+p[2]*t+p[3],\n'sqrt1':lambda p:p[0]*np.sqrt(1+p[1]*t)+p[2]*t+p[3],\n'logpow':lambda p:p[0]*np.log(1+p[1]*t**p[2])+p[3],\n}\nrng=np.random.default_rng(0)\nfor n,f in forms.items():\n    best=None\n    for s in range(12):\n        p0=rng.uniform(0.2,2,4)*rng.choice([-1,1],4)\n        try:\n            r=least_squares(lambda p:f(p)-dA_dt,p0)\n            if best is None or r.cost<best.cost:best=r\n        except Exception as e:pass\n    print(n,2*best.cost/len(t)/dA_dt.var(),best.x)", "out": "log1p+lin 6.755844779345181e-06 [ 3.84578512  1.13698156  0.34674163 -9.75893415]\npow shift 2.50116962786191e-05 [  6.02557166   0.12864534   0.42686173 -12.82512005]\nlog+pow 2.6475936067296195e-05 [ -0.47677518   7.13210218   0.40381342 -13.61085363]\nexp+lin 2.001538096922207e-05 [-5.46325815  0.44955758  0.72372184 -3.75248988]\nrat 1.8379826039770678e-24 [ 3.27405  0.345    0.553   -9.49   ]\ntanh 0.00014255363066350288 [ 4.46066055  0.34596501  0.7801174  -8.79479776]\natan 3.0512020729974824e-05 [-4.39284973 -0.44370118  0.65084127 -9.01156738]\nsqrt1 0.03100744823783146 [-3.94890207e+00 -1.51405161e-06  1.06447039e+00 -2.59162043e+00]\nlogpow 2.8984976597773908e-05 [ 1.70971528e+02  3.06038116e-02  4.76516047e-01 -1.16301178e+01]\n\n[stderr]\n<string>:6: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in log\n<string>:7: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in power\n<string>:13: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in sqrt\n<string>:14: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in log\n"}
